<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fila Holdings downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fila Holdings downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns analyst Susan Sansbury confirmed she downgraded her rating on Fila Holdings SpA to neutral from attractive.</p>
<p>-- She declined to give further details on the move.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 1/2 at 41-3/4.</p>
</text>
